      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 245: 🔴 In CI, returning early when `VCPKG_ROOT` is a valid git clone skips the Jenkins-only env setup (`VCPKG_BINARY_SOURCES` default to `clear`, `VCPKG_DISABLE_METRICS\u003d1`). This re-enables default binary caching under `%LOCALAPPDATA%`, conflicting with the stated CI isolation behavior and causing non-hermetic builds. Apply the CI env setup regardless of whether the root comes from `VCPKG_ROOT` or from `build/vcpkg` (e.g., set Jenkins vars before any return, or factor into a shared post-selection block).",
